  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the smoked salmon, ferment jang, lemon juice, and olive oil, and mix well.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cucumber to the bowl and stir gently to combine.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, give the mixture a good stir and adjust the seasoning if needed.",
    "Serve the poke in small bowls or glasses, garnished with additional chopped onion and cucumber if desired."
